#ASSERT `a person is eligible when they meet prescribed conditions and are a special PPL claimant in exceptional circumstances` (`The claimant's facts on a flexible PPL day` OF TRUE, TRUE, 0, TRUE, (JUST TRUE), (JUST TRUE), TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, 0) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the work test and income test are not asked of a special PPL claimant by paragraph (5)
#ASSERT `a person is eligible when they meet prescribed conditions and are a special PPL claimant in exceptional circumstances` (`The claimant's facts on a flexible PPL day` OF TRUE, TRUE, 0, TRUE, (JUST FALSE), (JUST TRUE), TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, 0) EQUALS JUST TRUE

