-- the work test result is not settled: the answer is not settled
#ASSERT `a person is eligible for parental leave pay on a flexible PPL day for a child` (`the invented birth date`) (`The claimant's facts on a flexible PPL day` OF TRUE, TRUE, 0, TRUE, NOTHING, (JUST TRUE), TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, 0) EQUALS NOTHING
-- section 31AA(1)(a): any one of subsections (2) to (5) is enough
